{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Every Letter",
    "steam_appid": 2379720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your typewriter, write letters on behalf of others, and transform their sentiments into words in this cozy single-player letter writing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.poster.avif?t=1740191674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.webm?t=1740191674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.mp4?t=1740191674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first day of your new job as a letter writer, typing freely on your typewriter. Receive requests from clients and turn their messages and feelings into letters, from casual hellos to love letters and theater scripts. As you write, uncover intertwining stories told across multiple clients\u2019 requests, grow accustomed to the quirks of a typewriter, and find your own meaning to letter writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven, single-player game with a charming cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen possible letter requests with side stories spanning multiple requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovingly detailed typewriter, down to the satisfying clicks and clacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Content warning: written mention of death and grief, written mentions of food)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to XtlusArt, the Locasaurus team, Lucie Teuli\u00e8res, Sasha Boucheron, Sarah Deville, Anabel Morales, \u014ckami, Hasanh, Ayliz Y\u0131ld\u0131z, Haigang Zhou, Rafaela Fernandes, and\u00a0Nhung Tran for their hard work helping make Every Letter!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your typewriter, write letters on behalf of others, and transform their sentiments into words in this cozy single-player letter writing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.poster.avif?t=1740191674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.webm?t=1740191674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379720/extras/5921f5677e01ca443c707da6e643cea1.mp4?t=1740191674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first day of your new job as a letter writer, typing freely on your typewriter. Receive requests from clients and turn their messages and feelings into letters, from casual hellos to love letters and theater scripts. As you write, uncover intertwining stories told across multiple clients\u2019 requests, grow accustomed to the quirks of a typewriter, and find your own meaning to letter writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven, single-player game with a charming cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen possible letter requests with side stories spanning multiple requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovingly detailed typewriter, down to the satisfying clicks and clacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Content warning: written mention of death and grief, written mentions of food)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to XtlusArt, the Locasaurus team, Lucie Teuli\u00e8res, Sasha Boucheron, Sarah Deville, Anabel Morales, \u014ckami, Hasanh, Ayliz Y\u0131ld\u0131z, Haigang Zhou, Rafaela Fernandes, and\u00a0Nhung Tran for their hard work helping make Every Letter!</p>",
    "short_description": "Write letters with your typewriter on behalf of others in this cozy single-player game. Compose everything from simple hellos to theater scripts and love letters, express each client\u2019s emotions, and find your own meaning to letter writing.",
